 36S  c  {+36}S production:                                                     
 36S  c  2012Zh06: {+9}Be({+40}Ar,X) E=57 MeV/nucleon, measured fragment yields.
 36S  c  2008IdZZ: {+24}Mg({+18}O,x|g) E=70 MeV, measured E|g, I|g, |g|g-coin.  
 36S  c  2003Wa23: {+36}Cl(n,p){+36}S at E=0.1-350 keV, measured |s.            
 36S  c  2002Go28: {+39}Ar(n,|g){+36}S, E=thermal, measured |s upper limit.     
 36S  c  2001Go29: {+39}Ar(n,|g){+36}S at E<100 keV, Maxwellian-averaged |s.    
 36S  c  1985Ko43: {+20}Ne({+16}O,{+16}O') at E(c.m.)=24.5-35.5 MeV; deduced    
 36S 2c  resonances.                                                            
 36S  c  1985Gy02, 1985GyZZ: {+36}S(|p-,|p-) E=48.4 MeV, measured |s(|q).       
 36S  c  1971Ar32: {+232}Th({+40}Ar,X) at E=290 MeV, measured yields.           
 36S  c  {+36}S radius measurements:                                            
 36S  c  1985Sc05: measured muonic x-ray energies, deduced rms charge radii.    
 36S  c  1983Ry04: measured |s(|q) in {+36}S(e,e) at E=120, 240, 320 MeV;       
 36S 2c  deduced charge radius.                                                 
