 36S  c  2001Wa50: mass differences and binding energies from {+36}S(p,n) at    
 36S 2c  E|?=2 MeV and {+36}Cl(n,p) reactions.                                  
 36S  c  Theoretical calculations:                                              
 36S  c  2023Ch34: ab initio interactions, levels, J, |p and moments.           
 36S  c  2023Dr01: shell model (ZBM2, USDB, sdpfu-mix, GXPF1A), 2+ level and    
 36S 2c  B(E2) in {+36}S.                                                       
 36S  c  2023Fo05: shell model, B(E2), B(M1) and transition matrix elements.    
 36S  c  2018Va09: shell model (sdpfu-mix), levels, J, |p; mirror energy        
 36S 2c  differences in {+36}Ca-{+36}S.                                         
 36S  c  2017Bo18: shell model (PSDPF), levels, J, |p, B(E2), and B(E3).        
 36S  c  2017Bo20: shell model (PSDPF), 2+ and 3- levels, B(E2) and B(E3).      
 36S  c  2017De15: HF+BCS+QRPA (Gogny), 1-, 2+, 3- energies, B(E2), B(M1).      
 36S  c  2016Si02: ab initio, first 2+ levels, S(2n), S(2p), uncertainties.     
 36S  c  2009Bo30: shell model (PSDPFB), negative-parity intruder levels, J, |p.
 36S  c  2006St21: shell model, level energies, g factors, B(E2), deformation.  
 36S  c  2006In01: self-consistent RPA, spins, octupole strengths.              
